<h2 id="hint-evolving-the-chronicle-sword">HINT:  Evolving the Chronicle Sword</h2>
<p>I've put together the quickest path from the Macho Sword to the Chronicle Sword without using any SynthSphere attachments.  Here is a list of the gems to attach to efficiently build up each weapon into the next best weapon.</p>
<h4 id="macho-sword" class="tier">Macho Sword</h4>
<p>Diamond x6, Peridot x3, Ruby x2, Sapphire x1, Pearl x3</p>
<h4 id="aga-s-sword" class="tier">Aga's Sword</h4>
<p>Garnet x1, Ruby x1, Aquamarine x1, Amethyst x3, Sapphire x3, Pearl x6</p>
<h4 id="atlamillia-sword" class="tier">Atlamillia Sword</h4>
<p>Garnet x3, Aquamarine x2, Sapphire x3, Peridot x6</p>
<p>Using the gems outlined above you should be able to build up the Macho Sword after four upgrades but should take up one more level to infuse more gems in the sword, saving steps later on when building up the Atlamillia Sword.  The same applies to the Aga's Sword which will also be able to build up within four upgrades but should be taken up another level as well which will allow you to build up the Atlamillia Sword after the fifth upgrade, giving you the Chronicle Sword in fifteen total upgrades.</p>
